  "title": "Mud Pie I",
  "description": "A sweet, buttery cocoa filling is poured into a prepared pie pan and baked. While still hot, holes are pricked in the pie and a luscious fudge sauce is spread over the top. Sweetened whipped cream is then spooned over the fudge layer, and more sauce is drizzled over that.",
  "authors": [
